7,Bosavi: Rainforest Music from Papua New Guinea,https://folkways.si.edu/bosavi-rainforest-music-from-papua-new-guinea/world/album/smithsonian,"Two generations of Bosavi musicians and 25 years of field recordings: a comprehensive and intimate musical portrait of life in a Papua New Guinea rainforest community. Includes the contemporary music of the youngest generation of guitar band composers, and performances of many traditional …","Koiali, Mountain",Trans-New Guinea
8,Mountain Koiali - mossyrune,https://mossyrune.com/language/mountain-koiali,"Mountain Koiali, a language spoken by 4K people. Classification, region, writing system, and what we know about it at a glance.","Koiali, Mountain",Trans-New Guinea
9,Steep Slopes: Music and change in the Highlands of Papua New Guinea on ...,https://www.jstor.org/content/oa_book_monograph/j.ctt24hcqd,"This is the study of the musical practices of the Duna—a remote, rural community in the Highlands of Papua New Guinea. Inspired by the frequency and popularity of Western-style songs composed by the Duna people themselves, I began to research these compositions alongside the pre-contact genres that I had arrived in the region to study.","Koiali, Mountain",Trans-New Guinea
